Z||000000||BlackDragon||12-03-2001||11:51 PM||||i finaly got my duke together. for those of you who dont know the story, i bought an 84 for $300 with a shatered rod. got a free block from phillipine (thanks a million) needed a little work, but $1300 later its a new motor. still need an injector, mine leaks and runs realy rich. also busted a break line in the back today, i think the caliper is locked up or something, but the important thing is that i can get in and turn the key and it starts up. dont have pics yet, but i will. wait till you all see the exhaust system i put together....short? oh yeah. it goes straight down off of the manifold and straight out the back with a glasspack near the end. will post pics as soon as i can. may be a week or two though<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> ITS ALIVE!!!!!!||||reg||1
